Z||000015||stsmithgt||06-15-2001||03:54 PM||||I stuck mine behind the passenger seat.  I figured that would be the easiest place to get to considering:<P>If it were in the back and the fire got too big...sit back and watch it melt.  In the front would be nice unless it was an accident that made it catch on fire and the hood latch was jammed.  Again sit back and watch it melt.  At least I know I can get behind the seat by tilting it forward or sliding it forward. <I> Did I over think this??????</I><P>------------------<BR>My work of art.(in progress.)    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/carpicsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
